00:31:04,720 --> 00:31:08,800
And we, and we have, we have been lucky in that we have, we have back founders that have figured out that model.

355
00:31:08,960 --> 00:31:16,800
Like we, one of our portfolio companies is a company, Pretty Litter, and it's a subscription cat litter that is also, also health detecting.

