00:31:16,880 --> 00:31:21,840
So it's innovative in that if the cat pees on it and one of a few things is wrong with the cat, it will change color.

357
00:31:22,080 --> 00:31:23,600
So it's like, it's an innovative product.

358
00:31:23,920 --> 00:31:26,560
It was also crystal based, eighty percent lighter traditional litter.

359
00:31:26,720 --> 00:31:27,920
It shipped very cost effectively.

360
00:31:28,560 --> 00:31:33,120
And the founder, Daniel Rotman, just did a remarkable job building a subscription business on the back of it.

361
00:31:33,440 --> 00:31:38,480
The reason though he was able to do it is because litter is almost the perfect subscription product.

