00:31:38,720 --> 00:31:40,560
It is predictable to consumption, right?

363
00:31:40,800 --> 00:31:42,080
Exactly predictable to consumption.

364
00:31:42,160 --> 00:31:44,960
The next one, one bag shows up, you throw out the old thing and you're off.

365
00:31:45,520 --> 00:31:52,240
I'm thinking of physical good subscriptions that I have that I've kept is like my lunches and, uh, coffee because exactly that.

