00:31:52,720 --> 00:31:55,520
I eat five lunches a week and I drink coffee seven times a week.

367
00:31:55,840 --> 00:31:56,480
That's exactly right.

368
00:31:56,640 --> 00:31:58,000
No, that's what I'm saying.

369
00:31:58,160 --> 00:32:01,360
So when the, when the consumption is not variable, subscription works extremely well.

370
00:32:01,520 --> 00:32:03,520
When the consumption is variable or unpredictable, it works.

371
00:32:04,000 --> 00:32:04,560
horribly bad.

372
00:32:06,240 --> 00:32:11,520
And you see this, by the way, in the data with, you know, some of the food subscription businesses that are more like meal kit prep.

